====== TP-Link Archer VR200 / VR200v ======
Dual band AC750 VDSL2 Modem Router with telephony capabilities, ''[[docs:techref:hardware:soc:soc.lantiq|Lantiq]]''-target

This router bears similarities with [[toh:tp-link:td-w8970_v1|TP-Link TD-W8970]].

The router is targeted towards German market, but could easily be used in rest of Europe as well.

The current TP-Link firmware is based on OpenWrt Backfire 10.03.1_LTQ. See ongoing research on the [[https://github.com/xdarklight/mktplinkfw3/blob/master/README.md|v3 header]].

Flashing using u-boot serial console to upload image through tftp works.

The VR200v image also works on the VR200, which is essentially the same target without POTS ports.


OEM source code available at: [[http://www.tp-link.com/resources/gpl/Archer-VR200v_GPL.tar.gz|Archer-VR200v_GPL.tar.gz]]


